{"user": "what would you anticipate would be white's next move if I put the chip in b7?", "user_ts": "2026-08-07T12:43:02.218540+00:00", "assistant": "If you play **b7**, I\u2019d expect White to look at **a8** next.\n\nWhy: your disc on **b7** makes the **a8 corner** legal for White by the diagonal **a8\u2013b7\u2013c6\u2013d5**. That\u2019s the usual danger of playing the X-square near an empty corner.\n\nBut here, **b7 can still be strong** because it flips a big row and sets up the endgame count/mobility\u2014not just the corner.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-07T12:43:33.605031+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-07T12:43:42.690878+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 2, "Paraphrase": 1, "Provide Correct Answer": 2, "Neutral Feedback": 2}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666, "Paraphrase": 0.3333333333333333, "Provide Correct Answer": 0.6666666666666666, "Neutral Feedback": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Paraphrase"], "llama": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Neutral Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Princ